<title>USA: Appliance Recycling votes reverse split.</title>
<headline>Appliance Recycling votes reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Appliance Recycling Centers of America Inc Monday announced a 1-for-4 reverse stock split, effective February 21.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be rounded up to the nearest whole share, the company said.</p>
<p>In connection with the stock split, the company's authorized number of common stock will be decreased to five million, the appliance recylcer said, adding that giving effect to the reverse stock split, the company will have about 1.1 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
